+## Restore the context-window indicator
+
+On web and desktop, the context-window indicator is opt-in. To enable it, open
+**Settings > General > Legacy features** and turn on **Context window indicator
+(legacy)**. The circular indicator appears in the composer when context-window
+usage is available for the active thread.
+
+This setting controls visibility; enabling it does not change the model's context
+limit or enable automatic compaction.
+
